NOTICE TO SHIPPING No. FRBES-366/2026

Due to forecast winds of 35-40 knots, all bunkering operations at Brest anchorage are suspended from 16 Nov 06:00 LT until further notice.
Vessels already alongside a barge must stop transfers and secure hoses.

This notice is issued for information to all port users.
Brest Port Information Service
